# Speedup verification harness.
#
# Everything in verify/ is scratch by default -- run output directories,
# *.log files, the tabulation cache, generated config.yaml dumps, *.txt data.
# We track only the curated configs and scripts the FAST docs reference, so the
# benchmarks can be re-derived from a clean checkout.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include the committed configs + scripts.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.sh
!*.py
!box_fast.yaml
!box_heavy.yaml
!config_box_VDF.yaml
!potentials_nomd.yaml
!potentials_md.yaml
!strings_collider.yaml
!strings_heavy.yaml
